// Local iOS build secrets - copy this file to "Secrets.xcconfig" (same
// folder) and fill in real values. Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored: never
// commit it, and never paste its values into logs, issues or chat.
//
// The Google Maps iOS key is REQUIRED. A build without it would install and
// launch, then crash (GMSServices abort) as soon as Running opens a map, so
// the Runner target's "Check Google Maps key" build phase
// (ios/scripts/check_maps_key.sh) fails the build instead.
//
// Get a Google Maps iOS API key from Google Cloud Console
// (APIs & Services > Credentials). Restrict it to iOS apps with bundle ID
// ca.gohardapp, and to the "Maps SDK for iOS" API only.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY = YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_IOS_API_KEY

// Compile-only builds (e.g. checking that the project compiles without a
// key): uncomment the line below. It overrides the key check, even for the
// placeholder above. The resulting app CRASHES when Running opens a map -
// never install it on a device for testing and never distribute it.
// GOHARD_ALLOW_MISSING_MAPS_KEY = YES
